This product includes a Python port of parts of Factbag
(https://github.com/factbag/factbag), Copyright Factbag contributors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

- factbag_core.py: the four-valued value lattice (false < unknown < conflicted
  < true), the evidence and rule combination of `evaluateGroundAtom`, open-
  and closed-world absence, negation as failure, and the proof tree.
- factbag_jev.py: the classification task text and the ASSERT / DENY /
  IRRELEVANT criteria, the admission rule, the KEEP / RETRACT resolver and its
  criteria, the passage id format and the recursive chunker.

The port is a re-implementation in Python, not a copy of the TypeScript
source; the Apache-2.0 licence of the original applies to the parts derived
from it, which are also distributed here under the AGPL-3.0-or-later.
